          <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 26px 0px 0px;">A wardrobe full of clothes, yet nothing felt quite right.</p>
          <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 20px 0px 0px;">AUREA Mykonos started with a frustration many women know well. Pieces that looked beautiful online but disappointed in person. Trends that faded quickly. Fabrics that didn’t feel as good as they looked.</p>
          <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 20px 0px 0px;">We found ourselves searching for clothing that combined timeless design, exceptional quality, and everyday comfort — but it was surprisingly difficult to find all three in one place.</p>
          <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 20px 0px 0px;">That search became the foundation of AUREA Mykonos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    
    <section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
