        <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.85; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 30px auto 0px; max-width: 640px;">Every piece is thoughtfully designed with quality, comfort, and longevity in mind — because we believe a great wardrobe isn’t about owning more, but choosing pieces you’ll love and wear for years to come.</p>
      </div>
