            </div>
            <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px;">Our goal is to offer premium quality at accessible prices. With fair pricing, exclusive bundle savings, and lasting quality, we aim to deliver the best possible value — and an experience you’ll enjoy from your first order to your last.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(234, 226, 214); padding: 46px 42px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
