            <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px;">Every piece is made from carefully selected premium fabrics and finished with close attention to detail. From considered stitching to the way a garment holds its shape, we hold our clothing to a high standard so it looks and feels refined wear after wear.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(234, 226, 214); padding: 46px 42px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
