            <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px;">We believe clothing should feel as good as it looks. That’s why we choose premium fabrics and design every piece for a comfortable fit you’ll enjoy wearing all day. From soft, breathable materials to thoughtful cuts, every detail is made with your comfort in mind.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(234, 226, 214); padding: 46px 42px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
