            <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px;">At AUREA Mykonos, our team is dedicated to creating timeless designs that never go out of style. By combining thoughtful design with lasting quality, we create clothing you’ll enjoy wearing season after season, year after year.</p>
