    <section style="background: rgb(245, 240, 235);">
      <div style="padding: 52px 24px 56px;">
        <h1 style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(38px, 11vw, 52px); line-height: 1.04; margin: 0px 0px 28px; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);">Our Story</h1>
        <div style="position: relative; height: 400px; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 30px;">
          <img src="{{ 'about-story.jpeg' | asset_url }}" alt="Woman in a striped dress on the steps of Santorini" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center center; display: block;">
        </div>
        <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.82; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 18px;">A wardrobe full of clothes, yet nothing felt right.</p>
        <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.82; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 18px;">AUREA Mykonos started with a frustration many women know well. Pieces that looked beautiful online but disappointed in person. Trends that faded quickly. Fabrics that didn’t feel as good as they looked.</p>
        <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.82; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px 0px 22px;">We found ourselves searching for clothing that combined timeless design, exceptional quality, and everyday comfort — but it was surprisingly difficult to find all three in one place.</p>
        <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.82; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 0px;">That search became the foundation of AUREA&nbsp;Mykonos.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    
    <section style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255);">
      <div style="padding: 56px 24px; text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(138, 127, 112); margin-bottom: 20px;">Made to Last a Lifetime</div>
        <p style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(20px, 5.6vw, 25px); line-height: 1.34; color: rgb(17, 17, 17); margin: 0px 0px 22px;">Inspired by the timeless elegance of the Greek islands, we created AUREA Mykonos to offer clothing that outlives trends.</p>
        <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.82; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px;">Every piece is thoughtfully designed with quality, comfort, and longevity in mind — because we believe a great wardrobe isn’t about owning more, but choosing pieces you’ll love and wear for years to come.</p>
        <div style="position: relative; height: 340px; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 36px;">
