        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    
    <section style="background: rgb(245, 240, 235);">
      <div style="padding: 52px 24px 56px;">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 38px;">
          <div style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 700; font-size: 11.5px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(138, 127, 112); margin-bottom: 14px;">What we stand for</div>
          <h2 style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: clamp(28px, 7.4vw, 34px); margin: 0px; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);">Our Values</h2>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">
          <div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(234, 226, 214); padding: 32px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; color: rgb(199, 168, 103);">01</span><span style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);">Value</span></div>
            <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px;">Our goal is to offer premium quality at accessible prices. With fair pricing, exclusive bundle savings, and lasting quality, we aim to deliver the best possible value — and an experience you’ll enjoy from your first order to your last.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(234, 226, 214); padding: 32px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; color: rgb(199, 168, 103);">02</span><span style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);">Quality</span></div>
            <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px;">Every piece is made from carefully selected premium fabrics and finished with close attention to detail. From considered stitching to the way a garment holds its shape, we hold our clothing to a high standard so it looks and feels refined wear after wear.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(234, 226, 214); padding: 32px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; color: rgb(199, 168, 103);">03</span><span style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);">Comfort</span></div>
            <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px;">We believe clothing should feel as good as it looks. That’s why we choose premium fabrics and design every piece for a comfortable fit you’ll enjoy wearing all day.</p>
          </div>
          <div style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(234, 226, 214); padding: 32px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Milanesa Serif&quot;; font-weight: 500; font-size: 30px; line-height: 1; color: rgb(199, 168, 103);">04</span><span style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);">Longevity</span></div>
            <p style="font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.78; color: rgb(74, 74, 74); margin: 0px;">At AUREA Mykonos, our team is dedicated to creating timeless designs that never go out of style. By combining thoughtful design with lasting quality, we create clothing you’ll enjoy wearing season after season, year after year.</p>
